00:12:41.393 --> 00:12:42.826
Really?

00:12:43.629 --> 00:12:46.189
Why do people always treat me like shit?

00:12:46.699 --> 00:12:49.468
There're a lot of people out there
who can't find jobs.

00:12:49.468 --> 00:12:51.904
Hey, that's not what this is about!

00:12:51.904 --> 00:12:52.871
Oh...

00:12:53.539 --> 00:12:56.007
Whatever, it's not like you'd ever understand.

00:12:56.408 --> 00:12:57.643
What about, you know, that place?

00:12:57.643 --> 00:12:58.577
What?

00:12:58.577 --> 00:13:00.079
The hamburger stand.

00:13:00.079 --> 00:13:02.946
You could ask that guy to give
you one more chance.

00:13:03.949 --> 00:13:05.518
What, are you damaged?!

00:13:05.518 --> 00:13:08.354
I quit that place because that
old bastard pisses me off!

00:13:08.354 --> 00:13:10.489
He's the reason I'm in this
situation in the first place!

00:13:10.489 --> 00:13:12.081
Oh yeah, I forgot.

00:13:13.058 --> 00:13:16.061
Well, let's forget about all the "job"
business for a while.

00:13:16.061 --> 00:13:17.163
You know, just get our minds
off this dreary stuff.

00:13:17.163 --> 00:13:18.221
Yuan!
You know, just get our minds
off this dreary stuff.

00:13:18.531 --> 00:13:21.864
Can't you get it through your thick
skull that I'm desperate here?!

00:13:22.401 --> 00:13:25.805
Maybe someone who goes home to a place
where there's plenty of food every day

00:13:25.805 --> 00:13:27.206
just can't understand!

00:13:27.206 --> 00:13:28.207
Claire, come on...

00:13:28.207 --> 00:13:30.943
I barely scraping by! I can't afford
to go out and have fun!

00:13:30.943 --> 00:13:32.278
Claire...
I barely scraping by! I can't afford
to go out and have fun!

00:13:32.278 --> 00:13:33.579
I barely scraping by! I can't afford
to go out and have fun!

00:13:33.579 --> 00:13:36.182
I understand your money situation.

00:13:36.182 --> 00:13:37.444
What the hell do you mean by that?

00:13:37.683 --> 00:13:39.485
I could treat you to something like a movie.

00:13:39.485 --> 00:13:43.546
What, like I should be dependent on you?!

00:13:44.223 --> 00:13:46.158
That's not what I'm saying.

00:13:46.158 --> 00:13:47.927
Damn, lemons are the only things I can afford!

00:13:47.927 --> 00:13:48.561
You got this all wrong!

00:13:48.561 --> 00:13:48.928
And I like these! I can't live without them!
You got this all wrong!

00:13:48.928 --> 00:13:52.420
And I like these! I can't live without them!

00:13:53.966 --> 00:13:57.629
I'm sorry. That isn't what I was implying at all.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.139
It's just I...

00:14:00.139 --> 00:14:00.973
Listen.

00:14:00.973 --> 00:14:01.640
Huh?
Listen.

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:02.107
Huh?
You're getting on my nerves,
so just leave me alone.

00:14:02.107 --> 00:14:03.699
You're getting on my nerves,
so just leave me alone.

00:14:04.543 --> 00:14:06.443
I don't want to talk to you right now.

00:14:07.146 --> 00:14:08.306
Claire...

00:14:08.681 --> 00:14:10.273
I want to be alone right now.

00:14:11.183 --> 00:14:12.514
I'm sorry.

00:14:13.919 --> 00:14:15.750
I'm sorry, Clarie.

00:14:35.407 --> 00:14:36.738
Thank you.

00:14:37.076 --> 00:14:40.568
How are you feeling, Lise? Are you cold?

00:14:40.846 --> 00:14:42.014
That person...

00:14:42.014 --> 00:14:43.082
Huh?

00:14:43.082 --> 00:14:45.384
Herve... Herve?

00:14:45.384 --> 00:14:47.319
Huh? What did you say?

00:14:47.319 --> 00:14:49.514
He came and saw me.

00:14:50.856 --> 00:14:51.991
Herve...

00:14:51.991 --> 00:14:55.051
Ah, Herve. What was he doing here?

00:14:55.628 --> 00:14:58.062
Herve, I want to see him.

00:14:58.931 --> 00:15:00.262
I want to see him.

00:15:01.533 --> 00:15:02.727
Really?

00:15:03.369 --> 00:15:07.430
Herve, so I hear you met with
Lise after she awoke.

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:09.339
Why did you go to meet her?

00:15:10.476 --> 00:15:13.673
Don't talk to her about anything
that happened before.

00:15:14.313 --> 00:15:17.149
As far as she's concerned,
you two met here for the first time.

00:15:17.149 --> 00:15:20.019
At any rate, that's a memory you can
erase from her mind, isn't it?

00:15:20.019 --> 00:15:22.351
Well at present, I don't want to do
anything that's too hard on her.

00:15:22.855 --> 00:15:24.345
Just a little bit every day is fine.

00:15:24.924 --> 00:15:27.559
Just meet up with her regularly
and have a little talk.

00:15:27.559 --> 00:15:28.227
I won't do it.

00:15:28.227 --> 00:15:28.694
That's an order!
I won't do it.

00:15:28.694 --> 00:15:29.595
That's an order!

00:15:29.595 --> 00:15:31.290
Everything's about Lise, Lise!

00:15:31.697 --> 00:15:33.332
While Anna and Mireille are being
totally forgotten about!

00:15:33.332 --> 00:15:35.668
That's not true! The system hasn't changed.

00:15:35.668 --> 00:15:37.870
It's obvious that there are fewer
doctors taking care of them!

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:39.405
That's because their situation is stable.

00:15:39.405 --> 00:15:42.397
I'm not joking around!
Why don't you have a look at Mireille?

00:15:42.741 --> 00:15:45.044
Stable my ass! She's collapsed more
times than I can remember!

00:15:45.044 --> 00:15:45.644
And you're still giving her the
same old medicine!

00:15:45.644 --> 00:15:46.736
Herve!
And you're still giving her the
same old medicine!

00:15:47.012 --> 00:15:50.539
Hell, Dr. Bender doesn't even go to see them!

00:15:50.983 --> 00:15:52.918
No one's taking care of Anna and Mireille.

00:15:52.918 --> 00:15:57.412
You're wrong! Anna and Mireille are the
last women in our family.

00:15:57.957 --> 00:16:00.050
Why would you think I'd neglect them?!

00:16:00.459 --> 00:16:02.757
Those two are as important
to me as they are to you.

00:16:03.062 --> 00:16:06.065
I promise you, Herve, I am going to do
everything in my power for them.

00:16:06.065 --> 00:16:08.966
Lise is here because she may be of
use to us in the distant future.

00:16:09.368 --> 00:16:10.803
She is just here to help assure

00:16:10.803 --> 00:16:12.998
that we don't over-burden Anna and Mireille.

00:16:13.539 --> 00:16:15.029
What happened to Mom...

00:16:15.941 --> 00:16:17.710
isn't going to happen to Anna
and Mireille, is it?

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.268
Of course not.

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:28.952
Herve, we were just talking about you.

00:16:29.321 --> 00:16:30.622
Were you?

00:16:30.622 --> 00:16:32.249
Lise, this is Herve.

00:16:32.925 --> 00:16:34.119
Herve...

00:16:40.933 --> 00:16:42.601
Hey, don't you think this is cute?!

00:16:42.601 --> 00:16:45.804
No, hands down, this is the one.

00:16:45.804 --> 00:16:46.905
What do you mean?

00:16:46.905 --> 00:16:48.964
Just look at them, Sam.

00:16:49.274 --> 00:16:50.442
They look the same to me.

00:16:50.442 --> 00:16:52.978
And that, my friend, is why you're a lost cause.

00:16:52.978 --> 00:16:54.013
What do you mean?

00:16:54.013 --> 00:16:55.781
Check this one out! This bag!

00:16:55.781 --> 00:16:57.383
Oh! That's hot!

00:16:57.383 --> 00:16:58.450
Hey!

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.085
What am I going to do? Should I buy it?

00:17:00.085 --> 00:17:01.220
Hey!
What am I going to do? Should I buy it?

00:17:01.220 --> 00:17:01.353
What color would you get?

00:17:01.353 --> 00:17:02.154
Listen! Listen! You all deaf?
What color would you get?

00:17:02.154 --> 00:17:03.155
Listen! Listen! You all deaf?
White, maybe.

00:17:03.155 --> 00:17:04.023
Listen! Listen! You all deaf?
And me? Pink, I think.

00:17:04.023 --> 00:17:04.256
And me? Pink, I think.

00:17:04.256 --> 00:17:04.790
Hey, listen...

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:05.290
What's up with Rachel being all into
books and stuff lately?
Hey, listen...

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:08.660
What's up with Rachel being all into
books and stuff lately?

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:09.957
Don't you think it's weird?

00:17:10.462 --> 00:17:11.663
You think?

00:17:11.663 --> 00:17:14.466
No way! They're sold out?!

00:17:14.466 --> 00:17:16.935
The pink and white?!

00:17:16.935 --> 00:17:19.028
God, you all can be so annoying sometimes!

00:17:27.179 --> 00:17:31.309
Yeah, I just finished work. I'll be home soon.

00:17:33.085 --> 00:17:37.112
Yeah, okay. Is your brother there?

00:17:37.823 --> 00:17:42.123
Okay, I see. I'll pick up a cake or
something on my way back.

00:18:03.348 --> 00:18:05.942
Ah, here we go!

00:18:06.118 --> 00:18:07.642
What are you doing?

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:09.521
Hello, wallet!

00:18:09.521 --> 00:18:11.090
Claire, stop that.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:13.559
I don't think this is the time for that.

00:18:13.559 --> 00:18:14.793
Looks like I hit pay dirt!

00:18:14.793 --> 00:18:16.495
You should hand that over to the police.

00:18:16.495 --> 00:18:17.689
Yeah, yeah...

00:18:18.964 --> 00:18:21.033
Seeing this kind of stuff makes me
second guess doing this.

00:18:21.033 --> 00:18:22.334
Stop that!

00:18:22.334 --> 00:18:23.266
Huh?

00:18:23.869 --> 00:18:25.104
This is...

00:18:25.104 --> 00:18:26.093
Claire!

00:18:30.375 --> 00:18:31.342
Huh?

00:18:31.543 --> 00:18:32.805
No!

00:18:35.714 --> 00:18:37.382
That guy's a monster?

00:18:37.382 --> 00:18:38.679
Rachel!

00:18:39.618 --> 00:18:40.686
Claire!

00:18:40.686 --> 00:18:42.984
Wait! That's the guy from yesterday!

00:18:43.322 --> 00:18:44.414
What?!

00:18:46.992 --> 00:18:48.152
Kate!

00:18:51.063 --> 00:18:53.429
Rachel! Rachel!

00:18:56.034 --> 00:18:58.730
Help me, Claire...

00:18:59.304 --> 00:19:00.362
Claire...

00:19:02.674 --> 00:19:05.844
Claire! Hurry, Claire!

00:19:05.844 --> 00:19:07.079
But...

00:19:07.079 --> 00:19:08.307
This guy...

00:19:09.615 --> 00:19:10.843
this guy...

00:19:12.251 --> 00:19:13.752
has a wife...

00:19:13.752 --> 00:19:15.219
a normal life...

00:19:25.697 --> 00:19:27.096
Give me a break already!

00:19:27.833 --> 00:19:31.269
Hey! He's just some regular guy.

00:19:31.803 --> 00:19:34.873
He's just a regular person who's
got a wife and a family.

00:19:34.873 --> 00:19:36.738
Huh? A family?

00:19:36.909 --> 00:19:38.433
What are you doing?

00:19:39.044 --> 00:19:41.672
If you start second guessing yourselves,
you're going to end up dead.

00:19:41.847 --> 00:19:43.849
This is that guy from yesterday, isn't it?!

00:19:43.849 --> 00:19:46.374
Yes, it is. Do you have a problem with that?

00:19:46.552 --> 00:19:48.144
"Do we have a problem with that?"

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:50.088
You!

00:19:50.088 --> 00:19:51.490
I think I told you.

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:53.659
"He is a man you may end up
having to fight soon."

00:19:53.659 --> 00:19:55.827
Once they manifest, there is
no going back for them.

00:19:55.827 --> 00:19:58.063
He was no longer even human.

00:19:58.063 --> 00:20:01.266
Yesterday, you could have...
Before it came to this!

00:20:01.266 --> 00:20:02.234
That's not possible.

00:20:02.234 --> 00:20:05.567
We can't afford to have something go
wrong and compromise our cover.

00:20:06.038 --> 00:20:07.973
That's why we make a point to lead
them to a secluded area.

00:20:07.973 --> 00:20:10.209
Isn't there some other way?!

00:20:10.209 --> 00:20:13.245
There's gotta be a way to do something
so it doesn't have to come to this!

00:20:13.245 --> 00:20:14.813
There is no other way.

00:20:14.813 --> 00:20:15.681
How do you know if you don't try?!

00:20:15.681 --> 00:20:16.181
We know because we did try!
How do you know if you don't try?!

00:20:16.181 --> 00:20:17.239
We know because we did try!

00:20:17.916 --> 00:20:19.384
We tried!

00:20:19.384 --> 00:20:21.420
And we certainly don't need you to
tell us how to do our business!

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:25.023
We've been losing our comrades
to this battle for ages.

00:20:25.023 --> 00:20:26.422
That's why we know.

00:20:27.025 --> 00:20:29.061
Once they manifest, the only thing
we can do is kill them.

00:20:29.061 --> 00:20:33.623
Kill them before they start attacking
regular people and families.

00:20:37.069 --> 00:20:38.971
You have to become strong.

00:20:38.971 --> 00:20:42.031
You haven't begun to unleash
your true strength yet.

00:20:42.708 --> 00:20:45.744
There will even be times when each
of you may need to fight alone,

00:20:45.744 --> 00:20:48.440
