against many enemies.

00:20:49.181 --> 00:20:52.116
If you want to go on living,
you better start training yourselves.

00:20:53.118 --> 00:20:56.519
You won't last long if you let yourself
be ruled by emotion.

00:20:57.756 --> 00:21:00.692
We've confirmed that the New
Bodies created by Animus

00:21:00.692 --> 00:21:04.389
have the ability to produce
children for our bloodline.

00:21:04.696 --> 00:21:09.497
So, our family will continue to produce
offspring. That's what you are saying?

00:21:10.035 --> 00:21:11.036
Yes.

00:21:11.036 --> 00:21:13.266
Thank you, Dr. Bender.

00:21:13.872 --> 00:21:16.174
If our line can produce offspring,

00:21:16.174 --> 00:21:18.734
the only thing left to do is get
their "Book of Curses".

00:21:19.478 --> 00:21:23.778
Lise... All of our hope lies with her.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:30.522
Rock, rock the LM. C!

00:21:30.522 --> 00:21:32.820
One, two, everybody go!

00:21:40.932 --> 00:21:43.201
Toki wa kita, ima da, sou sa mada da!

